# Scratch
.scratch/

# Sibling projects under this workspace root, each currently its own repository.
# They are NOT part of this repo and `git add .` must not record them as
# gitlinks. Note that `practice-logger` is a planned merge into this app, not an
# unrelated neighbour — see docs/INTEGRATION-practice-logger.md.
piano-progress/
practice-logger/

# A real backup, kept so tests can run against real data rather than data we invented.
# It lives *outside* this repo — as a sibling of the repo root — so these patterns are a
# guard for the accident of one being copied in, and for the workspace root ever being
# made a repository, which it is not today. All three are anchored to the repo root on
# purpose: an unanchored `media/` would swallow any directory of that name at any depth.
# The data is real personal practice history, including a users table. See docs/TEST-DATA.md.
/piano-ecosystem-backup*.json
/media/
/*.bundle

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
